<title>UK: BZW sets call warrants on Pohjola.</title>
<headline>BZW sets call warrants on Pohjola.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd has issued one million American-style call warrants on Pohjola B shares, lead manager BZW Securities said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    160 FIM		   ISSUE PRICE  20.5 FIM</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	03.FEB.98		 PAYDATE	24.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT ONE</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  145 FIM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
